/**
@page architecture_diagrams Architecture Diagrams

@brief Rendered UML architecture diagrams (source: `uml/*.puml`), with pan/zoom.

These diagrams are hand-authored PlantUML describing the code as it exists now (see
`uml/README.md` for the full index and current-architecture notes). They are rendered to SVG
by the docs build (docs/doxygen/build_docs.bat) and embedded below with a small pan/zoom
viewer: scroll/pinch to zoom, drag to pan, and double-click or the toolbar to reset.

@htmlonly
<link rel="stylesheet" href="uml_pan_zoom.css">
@endhtmlonly

@section diag_01 01. Project Overview
High-level package/module structure and dependency direction.

@htmlonly
<div class="uml-viewer" data-uml-viewer>
  <div class="uml-toolbar">
    <button type="button" data-uml-zoom-in title="Zoom in">+</button>
    <button type="button" data-uml-zoom-out title="Zoom out">&minus;</button>
    <button type="button" data-uml-reset title="Reset view">&#8634;</button>
  </div>
  <div class="uml-viewer-inner"><img src="project_overview.svg" alt="Project Overview diagram"></div>
  <div class="uml-hint">scroll = zoom &middot; drag = pan &middot; double-click = reset</div>
</div>
@endhtmlonly

